Description: Modern Liquid Glass Spotlight Launcher for Linux
 Echo is an ultra-fast, visually stunning Spotlight/Raycast-like launcher
 and productivity hub built for Linux (GNOME, Cinnamon, KDE, XFCE, Wayland & X11).
 .
 Features:
  * Liquid glass aesthetics with translucent blur and dynamic theme support
  * Lightning fast fuzzy application search with usage ranking
  * Deep file search integrated with GNOME Tracker 3 SPARQL and instant cache
  * Instant inline math expressions and unit conversion
  * Clipboard history manager with rich previews
  * Full emoji and symbol catalog search
  * Rich preview inspector with object pooling
